- using verification confidence to determine role scope or security tier;
- synthesizing a constrained role rather than simply approving or denying access;
- automatically provisioning an environment that reflects the classification result;
- continuously re-evaluating both user and organization eligibility;
- preserving privacy while proving class membership or affiliation; and
- generating an auditable explanation that links evidence, classification, policy, and effective permissions.

